<document xmlns="http://cnx.rice.edu/cnxml" xmlns:m="http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML">
  <title>4.8.2: Self Check</title>
  <metadata xmlns:md="http://cnx.rice.edu/mdml">
    <md:content-id>m00983</md:content-id>
    <md:title>4.8.2: Self Check</md:title>
    <md:uuid>21f93bb9-6067-4098-a933-705214cb2edd</md:uuid>
  </metadata>
  <content>
  <note class="self-check"><para>The temperature \(t\), in degrees Fahrenheit, of a cup of coffee that was poured and then forgotten for \(m\) minutes is represented in the table below</para>
<table class="os-raise-horizontaltable">
  <tgroup cols="5"><tbody><row>
      <entry><emphasis>Time in minutes</emphasis></entry><entry>
        0
      </entry>
      <entry>
        15
      </entry>
      <entry>
        25
      </entry>
      <entry>
        40
      </entry>
    </row>
    <row>
      <entry><emphasis>Temperature</emphasis></entry><entry>
        185°F
      </entry>
      <entry>
        155°F
      </entry>
      <entry>
        140°F
      </entry>
      <entry>
        120°F
      </entry>
    </row>
  </tbody></tgroup></table>

<para>What was the average rate of change from when the cup was poured to 40 minutes later?</para></note>
</content>
</document>